1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:02,331
Stare at the dot on this blue banana.

2
00:00:04,031 --> 00:00:05,486
Do not move your eyes.

3
00:00:07,086 --> 00:00:08,006
Keep staring.

4
00:00:09,406 --> 00:00:10,418
Almost there.

5
00:00:11,068 --> 00:00:11,312
Now.

6
00:00:11,312 --> 00:00:12,408
What colour is it?

7
00:00:12,708 --> 00:00:14,535
Nothing on your screen is yellow.

8
00:00:15,635 --> 00:00:18,891
Staring wore down the cells in your eyes that sense blue.

9
00:00:19,191 --> 00:00:22,543
On white, the blue signal is weak, so yellow wins.

10
00:00:23,043 --> 00:00:25,204
Look back at the dot and try it again.
